criteria:
Inclusion criteria:

* age over 18 years;
* a clinically stable cardiovascular diagnosis.

Exclusion criteria:

* conditions precluding physical exercise (e.g., bone fractures);
* conditions precluding the use of virtual reality (e.g., blindness and deafness);
* severe cognitive impairment, documented by a score of 0 to 4 on the Six-Item Screener;
* end-stage renal disease requiring dialysis;
* established advanced pulmonary disease;
* active malignancies;
* rheumatic diseases.
